repository-code: https://github.com/sahuja-create/csf-proteomics-neurodegeneration
abstract: R analysis code and supporting gene sets and protein annotations for the accompanying CSF proteomics
  study. The workflow includes differential protein expression, gene set enrichment, figure generation,
  and biomarker association analyses. Restricted participant-level proteomic and clinical input data are
  not included.
